`opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-grpc`, `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-http`, `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-json-http`, `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-json-file`: stabilize the log exporter as the public `log_exporter` module. `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-proto-common`, `opentelemetry-exporter-otlp-json-common`: stabilize the log encoder as the public `log_encoder` module
